  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f22f57d0cf5c493280a0ab6b7dbaea9e3fc5b035c6d410d59c2f476043bd03a8.png] \n\nGiven : 234 * 345 * 456 * 567 * 678 * 12\n\nChecking all the options one by one by BODMAS rule we get,\n\n1. -, +, +, -, =\n\n**234 **- 345 **+ 456 + 567 ** - 678 = 12\n\n**1257 - 333** = 12\n\n924 ≠ 12 \n\n2. ÷, -, +, -, =\n\n **234 ÷ 345** - 456 + 567 - 678 = 12\n\n**0.67** - 456** ****+ 567** - 678 = 12\n\n**567.67 - 456 - 678** = 12\n\n566.33 ≠ 12\n\n3.+, ×, +, -, =\n\n 234 + **345 × 456** + 567 - 678 = 12\n\n** 234 +157320 + 567 **- 678 = 12 \n\n**158121 - 678 **= 12 \n\n157443 ≠ 12\n\n4**. +, -, +, -, =**\n\n **234 + 345** - 456 ** + 567** - 678 = 12\n\n1146** - 456 - 678 **= 12 \n\n**1146 - 1134** = 12 \n\n**12 = 12 **\n\nHence, **\"Option 4\"** is the correct answer.",
